{"id":"567189f4b7e57f6f","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs.md","title":"经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","display":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs","aliases":["91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs","91-prop-theory-trade-offs","91-prop-truth-theory-balances"],"display":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得","depends_on":["[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","[[91-df-transparency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs</span><span>91-prop-theory-trade-offs</span><span>91-prop-truth-theory-balances</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-theory-trade-offs — 经典自指透明性与一致性不可兼得"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5f78118711a12b83\" href=\"?note=5f78118711a12b83\" title=\"91-lem-T-schema-limits\">91-lem-T-schema-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" href=\"?note=41fdad0bfaff0bf5\" title=\"91-thm-diagonal-lemma\">91-thm-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b04a030dde171267\" href=\"?note=b04a030dde171267\" title=\"91-df-transparency\">91-df-transparency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 为采用经典一阶逻辑、语言为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 的理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为其一元原始谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\)</span> 为至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 自由的公式集。\n局部展开对角性质：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]\">\\(\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)\\)</span>\n采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b04a030dde171267\" href=\"?note=b04a030dde171267\" title=\"91-df-transparency\">91-df-transparency</a> 的全语言可证透明性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 为固定矛盾句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>应用展开的对角性质于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)=\\neg T(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)=\\neg T(x)\\)</span>，再将全语言透明性\n实例化于所得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，便满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f78118711a12b83\" href=\"?note=5f78118711a12b83\" title=\"91-lem-T-schema-limits\">91-lem-T-schema-limits</a> 的两个前提。\nPA 及自然句法表示保证这里的对角性质；一般理论则明确以它为条件，\n故没有把所有经典一阶理论一律判为不一致。</p>\n<p>这是一个精确的不可兼得结论：说谎者\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\">\\(\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})\\)</span> 与其透明\n双条件合成，经典逻辑推出矛盾。相应方案必须限制实例语言、分层真理\n谓词、改变透明原则，或改变相关语义/推理规则。</p>\n<p>这并不推出“保守、强、经典、完整”四个未定义标签之间的一般布尔定律。\n例如标准 FS 保持经典外层逻辑，但没有不受限制的自指全 T-schema；\nKF 的经典外层公理化也与其强 Kleene 语义动机并存。具体保守性和强度\n仍需独立的证明论定理。</p>\n<p>来源：§6 的对角方法及全自指 T-schema 的经典说谎者论证；对角性质、透明域和句法一致性已分别展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-lem-T-schema-limits","status":"resolved","id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"41fdad0bfaff0bf5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-transparency","status":"resolved","id":"b04a030dde171267","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-transparency]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-transparency","status":"resolved","id":"b04a030dde171267","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)$\n采用 [[91-df-transparency]] 的全语言可证透明性。","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-T-schema-limits","status":"resolved","id":"5f78118711a12b83","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"应用展开的对角性质于 $\\theta(x)=\\neg T(x)$，再将全语言透明性\n实例化于所得 $\\lambda$，便满足 [[91-lem-T-schema-limits]] 的两个前提。\nPA 及自然句法表示保证这里的对角性质；一般理论则明确以它为条件，\n故没有把所有经典一阶理论一律判为不一致。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\theta(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x)\\;\n\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\;\n[\\mathcal S\\vdash\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\\theta(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S)\n\\coloneqq\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}trade\\text{-}offs}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Diag}_T(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Trans}_{\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}}(\\mathcal S,T)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\neg\\operatorname{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta(x)=\\neg T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":2590,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-theory-trade-offs]]"}],"outgoing":["5f78118711a12b83","41fdad0bfaff0bf5","b04a030dde171267"]}